title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/viewer:zoom
catalog: GUI command
target: viewer:zoom
summary: File: zoom the previewed image/video

!! Reference

* Defined by the ``viewer`` panel

!! Default keys

* ``-`` → ``viewer:zoom out`` (in the ``viewer`` panel)
* ``0`` → ``viewer:zoom reset`` (in the ``viewer`` panel)
* ``=`` → ``viewer:zoom in`` (in the ``viewer`` panel)
* ``plus`` → ``viewer:zoom in`` (in the ``viewer`` panel)
* ``v z`` → ``viewer:zoom fit`` (in the ``viewer`` panel)
